dated":1781879502764,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Now with brand pixel\n\nIssue #1: pixel events + pixel_event_config\nused in campaign launch but are not autocreated this new column was just created\n\nPR 1930 filter — which restricts the picker to only the brand's own pixel and hides the\n  Wayward-pixel events the account already has \n\nIssue #2: What do we use the brand pixel for, only to replace the PURCHASE pixel event?\nAnd we still use wayward pixel for AffiliateClick. \n    - No only SALES / TRAFFIC is enabled for brands","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Now with brand pixel\n\nIssue #1: pixel events + pixel_event_config\nused in campaign launch but are not autocreated this new column was just created\n\nPR 1930 filter — which restricts the picker to only the brand's own pixel and hides the\n  Wayward-pixel events the account already has \n\nIssue #2: What do we use the brand pixel for, only to replace the PURCHASE pixel event?\nAnd we still use wayward pixel for AffiliateClick. \n    - No only SALES / TRAFFIC is enabled for brands","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"YYXZpn0D1l5tq4FZ8xIge","type":"rectangle","x":866.5978046178429,"y":1950.688739984369,"width":292.20703125000006,"height":76.76953125000003,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"aD","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":485123924,"version":310,"versionNonce":1396341484,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"PHJfy-YeIZA7SUXAZPPo4"}],"updated":1781879261666,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"PHJfy-YeIZA7SUXAZPPo4","type":"text","x":902.7014728307336,"y":1969.073505609369,"width":219.99969482421875,"height":40,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacit